TEXT 72 -304 Left 2 ;All units in ohm or Farad /km\n \nC10 = C11+C21+C31 = 8.172n -1.695n -1.6n =  4.877n ( Line to earth )\nC20 = C22+C21+C23 = 7.978n -1.695n -1.695n = 4.782n ( Line to earth )\nC30 = C33+C31+C32 = 8.172n -1.695n -1.6n = 4.877 n ( Line to earth )\nC12 = C21 = 1.695 (Line to Line)\nC13 = C31 = 1.6n (Line to Line)\nC23 = C32 = 1.695n (Line to Line) \n \n \n \n \nRL = R11-R21/2-R31/2 = 0.149 - 0.048 = 0.1 (operational resistance)\nRS = R11~R22~R33 =0.149 (self resistance)\nRM = R12~R13~R23 = 0.048 (mutual resistance)\nR0 = R11+R21+R31 = 0.149 + 0.048 + 0.048 = 0.245 (zero sequence resistance)\nRE = (R0-RL)/3 = (0.245-0.1)/3=0.05 (earth resistance)\n \nXL = X11-X21/2-X31/2 = 0.735 - 0.36/2 - 0.36/2 = 0.375 ( operational reactance for symmetric case) \nXS = X11~X22~X33 = 0.736 (self reactance)\nXM = X21~X31~X32 = 0.361 (mutal reactance)\nX0 = XS+2*XM=X11+X21+X31 = 0.736 + 0.36 + 0.36 = 1.458 (zero sequence reactance)\nXI = 1e6*mue0*0.25/2/pi = 0.05 (inner reactance)\nXA = XL-XI = 0.375-0.05=0.325 (outher reactance)\nXE = (X0-XL)/3 = (1.458-0.375)/3 = 0.36 ( earth reactance)
TEXT -112 -328 Left 2 ;ATP matrices:
